{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-03_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-03","title":"麦秆，极易燃烧","storyCode":"R8-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"73a32d4bcb2956309a1d32d864cd09ec9b98843af0cbd8f9a9b1eebd2e6b550c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿丽娜向塔露拉表明了自己的感染者身份，并终于说服她压下怒火，暂时离开。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃呃呃呃呃！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊......啊啊啊啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......！你......唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这把火是你放的吗！他们是你烧......呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"阿丽娜，抱歉。这一定会给村子带来很大的灾难。但是我无法忍受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法忍受这种事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿丽娜？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"塔露拉惊讶地看着阿丽娜。阿丽娜用塔露拉从没见过的眼神望着她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼里有一团火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"从你来这个村子的时候我就知道，你不会甘心在这个村子里呆下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你有你的来处，你从哪里来就要回到哪里去，这个村子容不下你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会回去。别这么看着我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"但你眼里确实有那一团火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要点燃什么，你想烧掉什么，你觉得这一切都不对，你在忍受，你忍到了极限......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不该是现在，塔露拉。不该是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"村民是无辜的。你一时的怒火只会害了他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么事——天哪！发生什么了！谁！是谁干的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！塔露拉！！走啊，走！！别回来了！！别回来！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老妇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陛下保佑，保佑我这个女儿一样的女儿吧，保佑她活下去，保佑她好好活下去啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，我们快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......那些可恨的纠察队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是感染者，村子里的人可不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是感染者，塔露拉。我也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......这里是......我们准备迁移过来的地方。地方已经建好了......可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......爷爷他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不能让他们再这么做.......不能让他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"他救了你，救了我，救了全村的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你却......搅黄了老爸爸他的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？那些村民，他们举报了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。你是说，举报爷爷他的，是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"是爷爷他自己。因为这样，纠察队就不会再查下去，情况理想的话，就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你再有实力也对抗不了纠察队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"这之后呢？要是宪兵来了呢？城市驻军和贵族老爷们的士兵来了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是没有足够的力量，等我们积攒了足够的实力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那并不对。不对，这事情不该这么看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"看着邪恶的事情在眼前发生却视而不见，只求自保，这并不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是自私，甚至无情的行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果公义需要更多暴力才能伸张，那还怎么能被称得上是公义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我还回答不了你这种问题，塔露拉。你读的书比我多，我知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"但这个村子今天已经死了一个人了。今天不应该再死更多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"你是很聪明的，你能想明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿丽娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"和自己说吧，塔露拉。和自己说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
